# GitHub logins of the repo's maintainers, one per line (case-insensitive).
#
# Maintainers may edit any app's manual entry or version, and need no
# author match on app fixes. pr-scope.yml reads this file from the PR's BASE
# commit, never the PR head, so a PR can't add itself. Changes need a
# code-owner review (see CODEOWNERS).
ArthurGibert

# The "chore: prepare release" PR is opened by prepare-release.yml with the
# default GITHUB_TOKEN, so its author is the Actions bot. Only workflows on
# main (CODEOWNERS-reviewed) can open PRs as this identity; a fork PR can't
# pose as it. Remove this line if you give the workflow a RELEASE_TOKEN of
# your own account instead.
github-actions[bot]
